e under equity compensation plans (excluding securities reflected in column (a))<br>(c)</font></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Equity compensation plans approved by security holders</font></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">3,246,747</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(1)</font></div></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="text-align:center"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">34.14</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(2)</font></div></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="9" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">4,219,097</font></td><